    <string name="unofficial_consent_title">Use unofficial lyric sources?</string>
    <string name="unofficial_consent_message">NetEase, QQ Music and Kugou have no public lyrics API. If enabled, this app calls their non-public endpoints directly from your phone to find lyrics (including word-by-word). That may go against those services\' terms (which forbid third-party clients and reverse engineering), and they could restrict your network access or account. Lyrics belong to their rights holders and are for personal viewing only. By enabling this you accept the risk yourself; the app\'s author is not responsible. If you decline, only LRCLIB and AMLL (public sources) are used. You can change this in Settings.</string>
